        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_220_grani#5\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#5.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 6,
        "raw": "[name=\"格拉尼\"]   果然只有这个洞口可以出入，对吧？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "格拉尼",
        "content": "果然只有这个洞口可以出入，对吧？"
    },
    {
        "id": 7,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003.png",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 8,
        "raw": "[name=\"可萝尔\"]   嗯。洞窟里面虽然有很多岔路，不过村里的大人带我来过几次，包括继任村长那天……",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "可萝尔",
        "content": "嗯。洞窟里面虽然有很多岔路，不过村里的大人带我来过几次，包括继任村长那天……"
    },
    {
        "id": 9,
        "raw": "[name=\"可萝尔\"]   ……那个，不知道是不是我的错觉，那边，森林里面的喊声是不是更多了……",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "可萝尔",
        "content": "……那个，不知道是不是我的错觉，那边，森林里面的喊声是不是更多了……"
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003.png",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "raw": "[name=\"格拉尼\"]   再拖延下去，情况只会更加恶化。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "格拉尼",
        "content": "再拖延下去，情况只会更加恶化。"
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "raw": "[name=\"格拉尼\"]   可萝尔，你知道山洞中的道路，我想让你马上进入洞窟，沿着暗道去提前拿到宝藏。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "格拉尼",
        "content": "可萝尔，你知道山洞中的道路，我想让你马上进入洞窟，沿着暗道去提前拿到宝藏。"
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003.png",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "raw": "[name=\"可萝尔\"]   欸？你是要……",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "可萝尔",
        "content": "欸？你是要……"
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003.png",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[name=\"格拉尼\"]   我留在这个洞口。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "格拉尼",
        "content": "我留在这个洞口。"
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003.png",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "raw": "[name=\"可萝尔\"]   不行！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "可萝尔",
        "content": "不行！"
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003.png",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[name=\"格拉尼\"]   唉？可萝尔……",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "格拉尼",
        "content": "唉？可萝尔……"
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003.png",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[name=\"可萝尔\"]   你要一个人面对那么多的赏金猎人？太危险了！你，你这样会——",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "可萝尔",
        "content": "你要一个人面对那么多的赏金猎人？太危险了！你，你这样会——"
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003.png",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[name=\"格拉尼\"]   如果不能帮你拿到宝藏，我既对不起村子，也辜负了你。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "格拉尼",
        "content": "如果不能帮你拿到宝藏，我既对不起村子，也辜负了你。"
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003.png",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[name=\"可萝尔\"]   ……可我不想失去你。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "可萝尔",
        "content": "……可我不想失去你。"
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[name=\"可萝尔\"]   这里，这里也不是你该逞英雄的场合……！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "可萝尔",
        "content": "这里，这里也不是你该逞英雄的场合……！"
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003.png",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"格拉尼\"]   逞英雄又有什么不好呢。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "格拉尼",
        "content": "逞英雄又有什么不好呢。"
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[name=\"格拉尼\"]   “即便心脏被敌寇的利刃刺穿，国王的骑兵亦不解下手中长枪。”",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "格拉尼",
        "content": "“即便心脏被敌寇的利刃刺穿，国王的骑兵亦不解下手中长枪。”"
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"格拉尼\"]   我绝不会在这里逃走。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "格拉尼",
        "content": "我绝不会在这里逃走。"
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003.png",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[name=\"可萝尔\"]   格拉尼……",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "可萝尔",
        "content": "格拉尼……"
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003.png",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[name=\"格拉尼\"]   而且可萝尔，这不只是我一个人的战斗。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "格拉尼",
        "content": "而且可萝尔，这不只是我一个人的战斗。"
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"格拉尼\"]   你也有你的战斗。也许你会因此遭遇危险，但只要能让这片土地回归平静……",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "格拉尼",
        "content": "你也有你的战斗。也许你会因此遭遇危险，但只要能让这片土地回归平静……"
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"格拉尼\"]   我们就必须去做这些。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "格拉尼",
        "content": "我们就必须去做这些。"
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[name=\"格拉尼\"]   宝藏那边就交给你了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "格拉尼",
        "content": "宝藏那边就交给你了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003.png",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"可萝尔\"]   可是……我一个人的话……",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "可萝尔",
        "content": "可是……我一个人的话……"
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[name=\"可萝尔\"]   宝藏……",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "可萝尔",
        "content": "宝藏……"
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003.png",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[name=\"格拉尼\"]   相信我。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "格拉尼",
        "content": "相信我。"
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[name=\"格拉尼\"]   何况，我一定会照顾好你的。在广场救下你之后我就已经下定决心，绝不会让任何人再从你这夺走什么。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "格拉尼",
        "content": "何况，我一定会照顾好你的。在广场救下你之后我就已经下定决心，绝不会让任何人再从你这夺走什么。"
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[name=\"格拉尼\"]   哪怕只是根头发。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "格拉尼",
        "content": "哪怕只是根头发。"
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003.png",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[name=\"可萝尔\"]   ……你明明还是一个小孩子……",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "可萝尔",
        "content": "……你明明还是一个小孩子……"
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#3\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003.png",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[name=\"格拉尼\"]   我可不是什么……我只是个子不高而已啊！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "格拉尼",
        "content": "我可不是什么……我只是个子不高而已啊！"
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003.png",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[name=\"可萝尔\"]   呵呵。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "可萝尔",
        "content": "呵呵。"
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[name=\"可萝尔\"]   ……嗯，我会和你一起行动的，格拉尼。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "可萝尔",
        "content": "……嗯，我会和你一起行动的，格拉尼。"
    },
